---
// VIP Deals Group Banner
---

<section class="my-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-800 via-purple-700 to-pink-700 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 text-white relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-purple-900/20">
  <!-- Ambient background shapes -->
  <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute -left-10 -top-10 w-60 h-60 rounded-full bg-pink-500/20 blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider backdrop-blur-md">
      <span>🔔 Notificações em Tempo Real</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black font-display tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
      Não perca as ofertas relâmpago que acabam em minutos!
    </h2>

    <p class="text-purple-100 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Sabe aqueles bugs de preço e cupons com 50% de desconto que duram poucas horas? No nosso grupo gratuito do <strong>WhatsApp e Telegram</strong> você recebe tudo em primeira mão direto no seu celular. Sem spam, só achadinho bom! 💜
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
      <a
        href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/JfqhZBxAiS9AVHGI2LIvGq"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-base font-bold bg-white text-purple-950 shadow-xl hover:bg-purple-50 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all"
      >
        <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
        <span>Entrar no Grupo VIP do WhatsApp</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-extrabold">Grátis</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="https://t.me"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-full text-base font-semibold bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/25 border border-white/20 text-white transition-all"
      >
        <span>Entrar no Canal do Telegram</span>
        <span>&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-6 pt-4 text-xs text-purple-200 font-medium">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-300 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        Mais de 8.400 membros
      </span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-300 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        Zero mensagens de spam
      </span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-300 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        Saia quando quiser
      </span>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
